      "translationReviewStatus": "independent-ai-reviewed",
      "translationReviewDate": "2026-10-20"
    },
    {
      "category": "rizq",
      "main_sentence": "“以适当的方式谋求给养的人，能免于今世的困苦和忧虑。”",
      "explanation": "妥善谋生，既要勤勉，也要采用真主所允许的方式，不应为了无止境地追求更多钱财而耗尽健康与安宁。",
      "source": "《益言》（Al-Fawāʾid）",
      "id": "iq-26",
      "sourceUrl": "https://iifa-aifi.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18.الفوائد-لابن-القيم.pdf",
      "sourceLocator": "Printed page 82; PDF page 82; local rendered fawaid-82.png",
